{"final_result":"**CrowdStrike (NASDAQ: CRWD) achieved the higher 2-year revenue CAGR.**

| Company | FY 2023 revenue | FY 2025 revenue | 2-year revenue CAGR |
|---|---:|---:|---:|
| CRWD | $2,241.236 million | $3,953.624 million | **32.82%** |
| PANW | $6,892.7 million | $9,221.5 million | **15.67%** |

Calculation: **CAGR = (FY 2025 revenue / FY 2023 revenue)^(1/2) − 1**.

CAGR difference = 32.8171% − 15.6661% = **17.1510 percentage points**, or **1,715.10 basis points**. Thus, **CRWD’s 2-year revenue CAGR was higher by approximately 1,715.10 basis points**.

CRWD’s fiscal years ended January 31; PANW’s fiscal years ended July 31. Revenue figures are consolidated total revenue from each company’s SEC Form 10-K.

